## markdown
# Inputs that must stay inert

js and data links.

```html
<script>alert('x')</script>
```

```html
<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>
```

`<a href="https://ok.example" onclick="steal()">`html link`</a>`

![bad]()

Text with `<b>`inline html`</b>` and an entity © and a literal \*star\*.

## html
<h1 id="inputs-that-must-stay-inert">Inputs that must stay inert</h1>
<p>js and data links.</p>
<pre>
<code class="language-html">&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt;</code>
</pre>
<pre>
<code class="language-html">&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</code>
</pre>
<p>
<code>&lt;a href=&quot;https://ok.example&quot; onclick=&quot;steal()&quot;&gt;</code>html link<code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>
</p>
<p>
<img src="" alt="bad" loading="lazy">
</p>
<p>Text with <code>&lt;b&gt;</code>inline html<code>&lt;/b&gt;</code> and an entity © and a literal *star*.</p>
